I like to play wizards.  They generally don't last long, but the magical
goodies are fun to experiment with.  Accordingly, my hackdir is filled
with bones files with lots of dangerous stuff.

Spoiler ahead:

































What do you do when you find a level with the remains of three or four
wizards?  The collection of potions, scrolls, and wands is too much to
carry, but too dangerous to leave laying around for the next dwarf or
gnome to pick up.  Chests, boxes, and bags are great but not always 
available.

The solution that I have just discovered is Elbereth.  Drop all of the
stuff, engrave, and go merrily on your way.  Since you are not standing
there, it should last forever.

Andrew Cockburn


